      "width": 354,
      "x": -1469,
      "y": 4987
    },
    {
      "height": 106,
      "id": "6cb440fa49ba14a1",
      "text": "$a = (x, y)$$\\lambda a = (\\lambda x, \\lambda y)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 320,
      "x": -1469,
      "y": 4683
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 50,
      "id": "948455c5ee694e3b",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-任意位置向量的坐标|任意位置向量的坐标]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 353,
      "x": -1502,
      "y": 5120
    },
    {
      "height": 84,
      "id": "c37e68e360ddab7a",
      "text": "$\\mid a\\mid = \\sqrt{(x_{2} - x_{1})^{2} + (y_{2} - y_{1})^{2}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 437,
      "x": -1489,
      "y": 5668
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "26906d4111bf5417",
      "text": "$a \\cdot b = x_{1}x_{2} + y_{1}y_{2}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 277,
      "x": -1489,
      "y": 5568
    },
    {
      "height": 104,
      "id": "2f9b377728e69ed3",
      "text": "此向量的有向线段的终点的坐标减去起点的坐标",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 374,
      "x": -1489,
      "y": 5248
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 60,
