      "x": 3027,
      "y": 18594
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "144d51d6998d9b34",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/倒序相加法与等差数列前 n 项和公式|倒序相加法]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 196,
      "x": 1815,
      "y": 18286
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "7d46889b274c5e1d",
      "text": "等差数列平均数$\\frac{a_{1} + a_{n}}{2} = \\frac{a_{1} + a_{2} + \\cdots + a_{n}}{n}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 269,
      "x": 2108,
      "y": 18346
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "fa3dc5046a369762",
      "text": "等差数列$S_{n}$图像",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 274,
      "x": 2460,
      "y": 18409
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "d8edb7555016bf1c",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-构造新数列|构造新数列]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 196,
      "x": 1815,
      "y": 18406
    },
    {
      "height": 274,
      "id": "6f9f8068ee57620f",
      "text": "已知  $b > 0$  且  $b \\neq 1$ ,如果数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是等差数列,那么数列  $\\{b^{a_{n}}\\}$  是否一定是等比数列?如果数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是各项均为正的等比数列,那么数列  $\\{\\log_{b}a_{n}\\}$  是否一定是等差数列?",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 507,
      "x": 1923,
      "y": 18856
    },
    {
      "height": 170,
      "id": "7f40dab4072b7fae",
      "text": "等差、等比都是归纳出来的递推公式",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 4028,
      "y": 18450
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "7876e1d800d500d0",
      "text": " $f(x) + f(2a - x) = 2b$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 3955,
      "y": 18050
    },
    {
      "height": 190,
      "id": "e3e5882caf2c2e22",
      "text": "已知各项均为正数的数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是公比不等于1的等比数列,且  $a_{1}a_{2023} = 1$  ,若函数  $f(x) = \\frac{4}{1 + x^{2}}$  则  $f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2}) + \\dots +$ $f(a_{2023}) = \\_$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是公比不等于1的等比数列, $a_{1}a_{2023} = 1$  ,则  $a_{n}a_{2024 - n} = 1,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*},n\\leqslant 2 023$\n等比数列目标和性质由  $f(x) = \\frac{4}{1 + x^{2}}$  可得,当  $x\\neq 0$  时  $,f(x) + f(\\frac{1}{x}) =$ ${\\frac{4}{1+x^{2}}}+{\\frac{4}{1+({\\frac{1}{x}})^{2}}}=4,$\n关键\n于是  $f(a_{n}) + f(a_{2023 - n}) = f(a_{n}) + f(\\frac{1}{a_{n}}) = 4,$\n【大招识别1与首尾两端等距离的两项的和相等,采用倒序相加法求和\n令  $T_{2023} = f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2}) + \\dots +f(a_{2023})$\n则  $T_{2023} = f(a_{2023}) + f(a_{2022}) + \\dots +f(a_{1})$\n两式相加可得  $2T_{2023} = [f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2023})] + [f(a_{2}) + f(a_{2022})] + \\dots +[f(a_{2023}) + f(a_{1})] = 4\\times 2 023,$\n所以  $T_{2023} = 4046$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">答案</span> 4046",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 449,
      "x": 3955,
      "y": 18110
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2c2c98bfd3b71094",
      "text": "基本量 $a_{1}$、 $q$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 3588,
      "y": 18663
    },
    {
      "height": 189,
      "id": "dd2567b848fd1d27",
      "text": "(2023全国甲卷)记  $S_{n}$  为数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和,已知  $a_{2} = 1,2S_{n} = n a_{n}.$\n(1)求  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的通项公式;\n(2)求数列  $\\left\\{{\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}}}\\right\\}$  的前  $n$  项和  $T_{n}$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> (1)当  $n = 1$  时,  $2S_{1} = a_{1}$  ,即  $2a_{1} = a_{1}$  ,所\n以  $a_{1} = 0$\n当  $n\\geqslant 2$  时,由  $2S_{n} = n a_{n}$  ,得  $2S_{n - 1} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1}$\n两式相减得  $2a_{n} = n a_{n} - (n - 1)a_{n - 1},$   即  $(n - 1)a_{n - 1} = (n - 2)a_{n}$  当  $n = 2$  时,可得  $a_{1} = 0$  故当  $n\\geqslant 3$  时  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n - 2}$  则  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}}\\cdot \\frac{a_{n - 1}}{a_{n - 2}}\\cdot \\dots$ $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}} = f(n)$  可式,采用累乘凑求通项  $\\frac{a_{3}}{a_{2}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n - 2}\\cdot \\frac{n - 2}{n - 3}\\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{2}{1}$  整理得  $\\frac{a_{n}}{a_{2}} = n - 1$  因为  $a_{2} = 1$  ,所以  $a_{n} = n - 1(n\\geqslant 3)$\n当  $n = 1, n = 2$  时, 均满足上式, 所以  $a_{n} = n - 1$ .\n注意检验\n(2)令  $b_{n} = \\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}}$ ,\n$\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}}$  是等差数列  $\\times$  等比数列的形式, 故采用错位\n相减法求和\n则  $T_{n} = b_{1} + b_{2} + \\dots +b_{n - 1} + b_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} +\\frac{2}{2^{2}} +\\dots +\\frac{n - 1}{2^{n + 1}} +\\frac{n}{2^{n}}.$ $①$\n$\\frac{1}{2} T_{n} = \\frac{1}{2^{2}} +\\frac{2}{2^{3}} +\\dots +\\frac{n - 1}{2^{n}} +\\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}}, ②$\n错位\n由  $① - ②$  得  $\\frac{1}{2} T_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} +\\frac{1}{2^{2}} +\\frac{1}{2^{3}} +\\dots +\\frac{1}{2^{n}} - \\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}} =$\n$\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}(1 - \\frac{1}{2^{n}})}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}} - \\frac{n}{2^{n + 1}} = 1 - \\frac{2 + n}{2^{n + 1}},$\n即  $T_{n} = 2 - \\frac{2 + n}{2^{n}}$ .\n检验: 设  $b_{n} = \\frac{a_{n + 1}}{2^{n}} = \\frac{n}{2^{n}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{2} n + 0\\right) \\times \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n - 1}$ , 故\n$\\begin{array}{l}{{A=\\frac{a}{q-1}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}-1}=-1,B=\\frac{b-A}{q-1}=\\frac{0+1}{\\frac{1}{2}-1}=-2,}}\\\\ {{T_{n}=\\left(-n-2\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}+2=2-\\frac{2+n}{2^{n}}.}}\\end{array}$\n2023\n事实上, 能用错位相减法求和的试题也可以通过待定系数法转化为裂项相消法求和, 原理:  $a_{n} = f(n + 1) - f(n)$ , 则  $S_{n} = a_{1} + a_{2} + \\dots +a_{n - 1} + a_{n} = f(2) - f(1) + f(3) - f(2) + \\dots +f(n) - f(n - 1) + f(n + 1) - f(n) = f(n + 1) - f(1)$ , 对于差比数列来说, 这里的  $f(n) = c_{n} = (an + b)q^{n}$ .\n另解  $b_{n} = n \\cdot 2^{- n} = \\left[a(n + 1) + b\\right] \\cdot 2^{- n - 1} - (an + b) \\cdot 2^{- n} = \\left(- \\frac{1}{2} an + \\frac{1}{2} a - \\frac{1}{2} b\\right) \\cdot 2^{- n}$ , 对比系数可得  $- \\frac{1}{2} a = 1, \\frac{1}{2} a - \\frac{1}{2} b = 0$ , 解得  $a = - 2, b = - 2$ , 则  $T_{n} = f(n + 1) - f(1) = \\left[- 2(n + 1) - 2\\right] \\cdot 2^{- n - 1} - \\left(- 2 - 2\\right) \\times 2^{- 1} = 2 - \\frac{n + 2}{2^{n}}$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 599,
      "x": 4080,
      "y": 18788
    },
    {
      "height": 157,
      "id": "ffa51686c554e657",
      "text": "已知等比数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 的公比 $q > 1$ ，且 $a_{3} + a_{4} + a_{5} = 28, a_{4} + 2$ 是 $a_{3}, a_{5}$ 的等差中项。数列 $\\{b_{n}\\}$ 满足 $b_{1} = 1$ ，数列 $\\{(b_{n+1} - b_{n})a_{n}\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $2n^{2} + n$ .\n(1)求 $q$ 的值.  \n(2)求数列 $\\{b_n\\}$ 的通项公式",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 598,
      "x": 4102,
      "y": 19023
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2d25685642fd88a4",
      "text": "$a_{n} = a_{1} + (n - 1)d (n \\geqslant 2)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 374,
      "x": 894,
      "y": 18040
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "dec63b85ca6397cc",
      "text": "$a_{n + 1} - a_{n} = d$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 207,
      "x": 447,
      "y": 18040
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "ac44e07576a7f04a",
      "text": "公比q",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 117,
      "x": 1212,
      "y": 18580
    },
    {
      "height": 99,
      "id": "24f90b63b8f43a7d",
      "text": "$S_{n}$  ,  $S_{2n} - S_{n}$  ,  $S_{3n} - S_{2n}$  成等比数列,公比为  $q^{n}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 506,
      "x": 3039,
      "y": 18855
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "661cd8a5af03e1ba",
      "text": "$a_{n} = a_{m}q^{n - m}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 207,
      "x": 1141,
      "y": 18856
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "a61456d38a64a24b",
      "text": "$\\scriptstyle{p + q = s + t}$,$a_{p} + a_{q} =$ $a_{s} + a_{t}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 387,
      "x": 1181,
      "y": 18136
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "aee83494a0a305dd",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-等差数列的图像|等差数列的图像]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 256,
      "x": 912,
      "y": 18406
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "792d08599e7abddb",
      "text": "$f(x) = d x + (a_{1} - d)(x \\in \\mathbf{R})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 401,
      "x": 447,
      "y": 18256
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "bc6ebba35d52e32e",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/等差中项|等差中项]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 447,
      "y": 18406
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "980bdc4a4e0843d3",
      "text": "$a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\frac{1}{n(n + 1)} (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 381,
      "x": 399,
      "y": 19580
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "b532ea129e2928d9",
      "text": "$a_{n+1} - a_n = d$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 464,
      "y": 19289
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "1fc973736a28d7fe",
      "text": "$a_{n+1} - a_n = n (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 465,
      "y": 19349
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "0c116f5f599509cb",
      "text": "$a_{n+1} - a_{n} = 2^{n} (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^{*}), a_{1} = 1$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 729,
      "y": 19433
    },
    {
      "height": 67,
      "id": "f3f8eee3326a6617",
      "text": "$a_{n} = (a_{n} - a_{n-1}) + (a_{n-1} - a_{n-2}) + \\dots + (a_{2} - a_{1}) + a_{1}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 639,
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 19312
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "ec90c5f298cb9a43",
      "text": "$\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} = d, \\{a_n\\}$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 454,
      "y": 20262
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "8bebed375004f94e",
      "text": "$a_{n+1}a_n = d, \\{a_n\\}$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 454,
      "y": 20087
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "77120919a79a8da4",
      "text": "$a_{n} = \\frac{a_{n}}{a_{n - 1}} \\cdot \\frac{a_{n - 1}}{a_{n - 2}} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{a_{2}}{a_{1}} \\cdot a_{1}(a_{n} \\neq 0)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 875,
      "y": 20201
    },
    {
      "height": 264,
      "id": "c1457bb31b3f1034",
      "text": "（2012新课标全国卷理16）数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_{n + 1} + (-1)^n a_n = 2n - 1$  ，则  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前60项和为\n分析 若  $a_{n+1}$  与  $a_n$  的关系式含有  $(-1)^n$ , 一般需分奇偶项讨论: 当  $n = 2k - 1$  和  $n = 2k$  时, 分别得到“等差型”和“等和型”的递推式, 以下分奇数项之和与偶数项之和分别求解. 解题时涉及两个角度: 角度  $1: d \\rightarrow 2n - 1$ ; 角度  $2: -\\rightarrow (-1)^n$ .\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 当  $n = 2k - 1$  时， $a_{2k} - a_{2k - 1} = 2(2k - 1) - 1 = 4k - 3 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ；当  $n = 2k$  时， $a_{2k + 1} + a_{2k} = 4k - 1 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ .\n两式相减可得  $a_{2k + 1} + a_{2k - 1} = (4k - 1) - (4k - 3) = 2$  ，即相邻的奇数项之和为2.\n前60项中所有奇数项之和为  $(a_{1} + a_{3}) + (a_{5} + a_{7}) + \\dots +(a_{57} + a_{59}) = 2\\times 15 = 30$  ，又因为\n$\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} a _ {2} - a _ {1} = 1 \\\\ a _ {4} - a _ {3} = 5 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ a _ {6 0} - a _ {5 9} = 4 \\times 3 0 - 3 = 1 1 7 \\end{array} , \\text {所 以} (a _ {2} - a _ {1}) + (a _ {4} - a _ {3}) + \\dots + (a _ {6 0} - a _ {5 9}) = 1 \\times 3 0 + \\frac {3 0 \\times (3 0 - 1)}{2} \\times \\right.$\n$4 = 1770$  ，则  $S_{60} = (a_2 - a_1) + (a_4 - a_3) + \\dots +(a_{60} - a_{59}) + 2\\times [(a_1 + a_3) + \\dots +(a_{57} + a_{59})]$ $1770 + 60 = 1830.$\n故  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前60项和为1830.\n\n变式（1）（2020新课标全国I卷文16)若数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_{n + 2} + (-1)^n a_n = 3n - 1, S_{16} = 540$  ，则  $a_1 = \\_$\n分析  $\\triangleright$  角度  $1: d \\rightarrow 3n - 1$ ; 角度  $2: -\\rightarrow (-1)^{n}$ .\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 当  $n = 2k$  时， $a_{2k + 2} + a_{2k} = 3 \\times 2k - 1 = 6k - 1 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ；当  $n = 2k - 1$  时， $a_{2k + 1} - a_{2k - 1} = 3 \\times (2k - 1) - 1 = 6k - 4 (k \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ .\n又  $a_2 + a_4 + \\dots + a_{16} = (6 \\times 1 - 1) + (6 \\times 3 - 1) + (6 \\times 5 - 1) + (6 \\times 7 - 1) = 6 \\times (1 + 3 + 5 +7)  -4 = 92$  ，则  $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} a_{3} - a_{1} = 6 \\times 1 - 4 = 2 \\\\ a_{5} - a_{3} = 6 \\times 2 - 4 = 8 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ a_{2k + 1} - a_{2k - 1} = 6k - 4 \\end{array} \\right.$ ，求和可得  $a_{2k + 1} - a_1 = \\frac{(2 + 6k - 4)k}{2} = 3k^2 - k$ ，所以  $a_{2k + 1} = a_1 + 3k^2 - k$ 。\n则  $a_1 + a_3 + \\dots + a_{15} = 8a_1 + 3(1^2 + 2^2 + \\dots + 7^2) - (1 + 2 + \\dots + 7)$\n$\\begin{array}{l} = 8 a _ {1} + 3 \\times \\frac {7 \\times (7 + 1) \\times (2 \\times 7 + 1)}{6} - \\frac {(1 + 7) \\times 7}{2} \\\\ = 8 a _ {1} + 3 9 2. \\\\ \\end{array}$\n所以  $S_{16} = 92 + 8a_{1} + 392 = 540$  ，解得  $a_1 = 7$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1838,
      "y": 20147
    },
    {
      "height": 264,
      "id": "6f20fc0ee5b481d3",
      "text": "设数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 满足 $a_{1} = 1, a_{2} = 2$，且对于其中任意三个连续项 $a_{n-1}, a_{n}, a_{n+1}$，都有 $a_{n} = \\frac{(n-1)a_{n-1} + (n+1)a_{n+1}}{2n}$，则通项 $a_{n}$ = \n分析思路一：由已知条件可得  $2na_{n} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}$  ，观察发现  $a_{n - 1},a_{n + 1}$  的系数和与  $a_{n}$  相等，所以可将  $2na_{n}$  拆为  $(n - 1)a_{n}$  和  $(n + 1)a_{n}$  ，从而与  $a_{n - 1},a_{n + 1}$  配对，将原递推公式转化为  $\\frac{a_{n + 1} - a_n}{a_n - a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n + 1}$  ，进而可将  $a_{n + 1} - a_n$  视为一个整体，设为  $b_{n}$  （角度2的形式），则符合累乘的特点.累乘后可得  $a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\frac{2}{n(n + 1)}$  （角度1的形式），再进行累加即可得到通项公式.\n思路二：本题还可以从递推公式中的“同构入手”，构造辅助数列， $a_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2n} \\Rightarrow na_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2}$ ，此三项具备同构特点，故设  $b_{n} = na_{n}$  则递推公式变为  $b_{n} = \\frac{b_{n + 1} + b_{n - 1}}{2}$ ，所以  $\\{b_n\\}$  为等差数列，其公差可由  $b_{1}, b_{2}$  计算，从而得到  $\\{b_n\\}$  的通项公式以求得  $a_{n}$ 。\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $\\triangleright$  解法一（累乘法与累加法）：从结构出发  $2n = (n - 1) + (n + 1)$ ，因此  $2na_{n} = [(n - 1) + (n + 1)]a_{n} = (n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}$ ，即  $(n - 1)(a_n - a_{n - 1}) = (n + 1)(a_{n + 1} - a_n)(n\\geqslant 2,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ ，即  $\\frac{a_{n + 1} - a_n}{a_n - a_{n - 1}} = \\frac{n - 1}{n + 1}$ .\n从而  $\\frac{a_3 - a_2}{a_2 - a_1} = \\frac{1}{3}, \\frac{a_4 - a_3}{a_3 - a_2} = \\frac{2}{4}, \\frac{a_5 - a_4}{a_4 - a_3} = \\frac{3}{5}, \\dots, \\frac{a_n - a_{n-1}}{a_{n-1} - a_{n-2}} = \\frac{n-2}{n}$ ，累乘得  $\\frac{a_n - a_{n-1}}{a_2 - a_1} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{2}{4} \\times \\frac{3}{5} \\times \\dots \\times \\frac{n-2}{n} = \\frac{1 \\times 2}{n(n-1)}$ .\n又  $a_2 - a_1 = 1$  ，所以  $a_{n} - a_{n - 1} = \\frac{2}{n(n - 1)} = 2\\left(\\frac{1}{n - 1} -\\frac{1}{n}\\right).$\n因此  $a_{n} = (a_{n} - a_{n - 1}) + (a_{n - 1} - a_{n - 2}) + \\dots +(a_{2} - a_{1}) + a_{1}$\n$\\begin{array}{l} = 2 \\left(\\frac {1}{n - 1} - \\frac {1}{n} + \\frac {1}{n - 2} - \\frac {1}{n - 1} + \\dots + \\frac {1}{1} - \\frac {1}{2}\\right) + 1 \\\\ = 2 \\left(1 - \\frac {1}{n}\\right) + 1 = 3 - \\frac {2}{n} (n \\in \\mathbf {N} ^ {*}). \\\\ \\end{array}$\n解法二（同构辅助数列）：由  $a_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2n}$  得  $na_{n} = \\frac{(n - 1)a_{n - 1} + (n + 1)a_{n + 1}}{2}$ ，因此数列  $\\{na_{n}\\}$  是等差数列，设公差为  $d$ ，则  $d = 2a_{2} - a_{1} = 3$ ，所以  $na_{n} = 1 \\times a_{1} + 3(n - 1) = 3n - 2 (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ ，可得  $a_{n} = 3 - \\frac{2}{n} (n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 600,
      "x": 2223,
      "y": 20147
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 217,
      "id": "c62b10162072504e",
      "text": "通过两个解法对比可发现，求数列的通项公式关键在于抓住递推公式的特点，构造出辅助数列，选取角度的不同也会导致运算复杂程度的差异.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 685,
      "x": 1838,
      "y": 19900
    },
    {
      "height": 58,
      "id": "c2368d80e82139fa",
      "text": "$\\lambda a_{n + 1} - \\mu a_n = d(\\lambda \\neq \\mu)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 360,
      "x": 1032,
      "y": 19522
    },
    {
      "height": 160,
      "id": "5b2ac6b92ff93e63",
      "text": "（2021浙江卷10改编）已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_1 = 1, a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} (n \\in \\mathbb{N}^*)$ 。记数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$ ，求证： $2 < S_{100} < 3$\n分析 一方面, 首先通过角度3和角度4,  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 - \\frac{1}{4} \\rightarrow \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{1}{2}$  (放缩), 累加可得  $a_n$  的下限表达式, 再求  $S_n$  的下限范围; 另一方面, 由角度1、角度2、角度4得  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} \\rightarrow \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3}$ , 由累乘法求出  $a_n < f(n)$ , 数列  $\\{a_n\\}$  求和, 经裂项相消证明出另一半结论.\n### 解析\n![](d61c24b86692a26e837799106537e96cab86865fffec0903297cac73bd23b9cb.jpg)\n① 证明  $S_{100} > 2$\n由  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}$  可得  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}{a_n} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}}\\right)^2 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2 - \\frac{1}{4}$ , 则  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} < \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2$ , 所以  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} < \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} + \\frac{1}{2}$ , 即  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n+1}}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{1}{2}$ , 则  $\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_{n-1}}}\\right) + \\dots + \\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_2}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_1}}\\right) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_1}} < \\frac{n-1}{2}$ .\n又因为  $a_1 = 1$ ，所以  $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{n + 1}{2}$ ， $\\sqrt{a_n} > \\frac{2}{n + 1}$ ，即  $a_n > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)^2} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^+)$ ，则  $a_n > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)^2} > \\frac{4}{(n + 1)(n + 2)} = 4\\left(\\frac{1}{n + 1} - \\frac{1}{n + 2}\\right)$ .\n故  $S_{100} = a_1 + a_2 + \\dots +a_{100} > 1 + 4\\left(\\frac{1}{3} -\\frac{1}{4} +\\frac{1}{4} -\\frac{1}{5} +\\dots +\\frac{1}{101} -\\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 1 + 4\\left(\\frac{1}{3} -\\frac{1}{102}\\right) =$ $1 + \\frac{22}{17} >2.$\n② 证明  $S_{100} < 3$\n解法一：  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\frac{2}{n + 1}} = \\frac{n + 1}{n + 3} a_n$  ，即  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3}$  所以  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} \\cdot \\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{a_2}{a_1} < \\frac{n+1}{n+3} \\cdot \\frac{n}{n+2} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{2}{4}$ ，即  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_1} < \\frac{6}{(n+3)(n+2)} = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+2} - \\frac{1}{n+3}\\right)$ .\n又因为  $a_1 = 1$ ，所以  $a_{n+1} < 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+2} - \\frac{1}{n+3}\\right)$ ， $a_n < 6\\left(\\frac{1}{n+1} - \\frac{1}{n+2}\\right)$ ，则  $S_n = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{4} + \\dots + \\frac{1}{101} - \\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 6\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{102}\\right) = 3 - \\frac{2}{34} < 3.$\n综上所述，  $2 <   S_{100} <   3$\n解法二：由  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}}$  得  $\\frac{a_{n + 1}}{a_n} = \\frac{1}{1 + \\sqrt{a_n}} < 1$ ，则数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  单调递减，且  $a_{n + 1} + \\sqrt{a_n} a_{n + 1} - a_n = 0$ ，即  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n - a_{n + 1}}{\\sqrt{a_n}} = \\frac{2(a_n - a_{n + 1})}{2\\sqrt{a_n}} < \\frac{2(a_n - a_{n + 1})}{\\sqrt{a_n} + \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}}} = 2(\\sqrt{a_n} - \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}})$ ，则  $a_{n + 1} < 2(\\sqrt{a_n} - \\sqrt{a_{n + 1}})$ ，因此  $S_{100} = a_1 + a_2 + \\dots + a_{100} < 1 + 2(\\sqrt{a_1} - \\sqrt{a_2} + \\sqrt{a_2} - \\sqrt{a_3} + \\dots + \\sqrt{a_{99}} - \\sqrt{a_{100}}) = 1 + 2(\\sqrt{a_1} - \\sqrt{a_{100}}) = 3 - 2\\sqrt{a_{100}} < 3.$\n综上所述，  $2 <   S_{100} <   3$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 706,
      "x": 1778,
      "y": 19440
    },
    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "8294643f762b8e1f",
      "text": "已知在数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  中， $a_{1} = 1, a_{2} = \\frac{1}{4}$ ，且  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{(n-1)a_{n}}{n-a_{n}} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$ ，求数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的通项公式。\n分析  $\\gg$  整理  $a_{n+1}$  和  $a_n$  的关系式，得到一个角度 1 中所阐述的“等差型”的递推关系式  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} - \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} = -\\frac{1}{n(n-1)}$ ，其中“等差  $f(n)$ ”是  $-\\frac{1}{n(n-1)}$ ，需裂项求和，通过累加法抵消中间各项得  $\\{a_n\\}$  的通项公式.\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $\\triangleright$  由  $a_{n+1} = \\frac{(n-1)a_n}{n-a_n}$  得  $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}} = \\frac{n}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{n-1}$ , 即  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} = \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{n(n-1)} (n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$ , 则  $\\frac{1}{na_{n+1}} - \\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} = -\\frac{1}{n(n-1)} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{n-1} - \\frac{1}{n}\\right)$ , 所以  $\\frac{1}{(n-1)a_n} - \\frac{1}{(n-2)a_{n-1}} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{n-2} - \\frac{1}{n-1}\\right)$ ,  $\\dots, \\frac{1}{3a_4} - \\frac{1}{2a_3} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{3}\\right)$ .\n叠加得  $\\frac{1}{(n - 1)a_n} -\\frac{1}{2a_3} = -\\left(\\frac{1}{2} -\\frac{1}{n - 1}\\right) = \\frac{1}{n - 1} -\\frac{1}{2}$  又  $a_{3} = \\frac{a_{2}}{2 - a_{2}} = \\frac{1}{7}$  可得  $\\frac{1}{(n - 1)a_n} = \\frac{1}{n - 1} +$ $3 = \\frac{3n - 2}{n - 1}$  所以  $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{3n - 2} (n\\geqslant 3,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$  ，又  $a_1 = 1,a_2 = \\frac{1}{4}$  也满足此式，因此  $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{3n - 2} (n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 706,
      "x": 1778,
      "y": 19280
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "48efc2c801315d07",
      "text": "公差d",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 125,
      "x": 1422,
      "y": 17980
    },
    {
      "height": 146,
      "id": "5bd3594704655612",
      "text": "等比数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的公比  $q\\neq - 1$  ,前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 291,
      "x": 2677,
      "y": 18904
    },
    {
      "height": 127,
      "id": "565d96631f0f1f80",
      "text": "在数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 中，已知 $a_1 = 1$\n(1) 若 $n a_{n+1} - (n+1) a_n = 1$ ，求 $a_n$ .  \n(2) 若 $n a_{n+1} - (n+2) a_n = 1$ ，求 $a_n$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 617,
      "x": 2523,
      "y": 19336
    },
    {
      "height": 68,
      "id": "cb7f7e23acccf78a",
      "text": "$f(x) = \\frac{a_{1}}{q} \\cdot q^{n}(x \\in \\mathbf{R})$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 320,
      "x": 488,
      "y": 18916
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "40cdcd122619f411",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第四章 指数函数与对数函数/4.2 指数函数/4.2 指数函数|指数函数]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 184,
      "x": 944,
      "y": 18919
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2366e78fa504baf9",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/等比中项|等比中项]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 185,
      "x": 488,
      "y": 19100
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "a6822fd23fd2644e",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-等比数列的图像|等比数列的图像]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 259,
      "x": 907,
      "y": 19050
    },
    {
      "height": 50,
      "id": "83a1d41e4931dcbe",
      "text": "形如  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{ba_n + c}{da_n + e} (d\\neq 0,be - dc\\neq 0)$  的分式型递推数列，当只有一个不动点时，可转化为等差数列求通项.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 442,
      "x": 1838,
      "y": 21522
    },
    {
      "height": 401,
      "id": "0ad22db137897c0c",
      "text": "已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $a_1 = 0,a_{n + 1} = a_n + 4\\sqrt{a_n + 1} +4(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$  ，则  $a_{n} =$\n分析 因为  $a_{n + 1}$  与  $a_{n}$  的关系式中含有  $\\sqrt{a_n + 1}$ ，所以整理化简递推式，设法得到\n$\\sqrt{a_{n+1} + 1}$  与  $\\sqrt{a_n + 1}$  的递推关系, 则  $\\{a_n\\}$  的通项公式便可顺理成章求出.\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $a_{n + 1} = a_n + 4\\sqrt{a_n + 1} +4(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$  ，可得  $a_{n + 1} + 1 = (a_n + 1) + 4\\sqrt{a_n + 1} +4$  即 $(\\sqrt{a_{n + 1} + 1})^2 = (\\sqrt{a_n + 1} +2)^2 (n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$  ，则  $\\sqrt{a_{n + 1} + 1} = \\sqrt{a_n + 1} +2(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$\n令  $b_{n} = \\sqrt{a_{n} + 1}$  ，则  $b_{n + 1} = b_n + 2(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^*)$  ，所以数列  $\\{b_n\\}$  是公差为2的等差数列，因此  $b_{n} = b_{1} + 2(n - 1) = 2n - 1(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$  ，则  $a_{n} = b_{n}^{2} - 1 = (2n - 1)^{2} - 1 = 4n^{2} - 4n(n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*}).$\n变式1 已知正项数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足  $\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1} + a_{n}a_{n+2}} = 4\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1} + a_{n+1}^{2}} + 3\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1}}$ ，且  $a_{1} = 1, a_{2} = 8$ ，求  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的通项公式.\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 将  $\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1} + a_{n}a_{n+2}} = 4\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1} + a_{n+1}^{2}} + 3\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1}}$ ，两边同除以  $\\sqrt{a_{n}a_{n+1}}$  得  $\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+2}}{a_{n+1}}} = 4\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}} + 3$ ，故  $\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+2}}{a_{n+1}}} + 1 = 4\\left(\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}} + 1\\right)$ .\n又  $\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_2}{a_1}} + 1 = 4$ ，故数列  $\\left\\{\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}} + 1\\right\\}$  是以4为首项，4为公比的等比数列，所以  $\\sqrt{1 + \\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}} + 1 = 4^n$ ，即  $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n} = (4^n - 1)^2 - 1$ 。于是，当  $n \\geqslant 2$  时，有  $\\frac{a_2}{a_1} = (4 - 1)^2 - 1; \\frac{a_3}{a_2} = (4^2 - 1)^2 - 1, \\dots, \\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} = (4^{n-1} - 1)^2 - 1$ ，因此  $\\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} \\cdot \\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}} \\cdot \\dots \\cdot \\frac{a_2}{a_1} = [(4^{n-1} - 1)^2 - 1][(4^{n-2} - 1)^2 - 1] \\dots [(4-1)^2 - 1] = \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} [(4^k - 1)^2 - 1]$ ，得  $a_n = \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1} [(4^k - 1)^2 - 1], n \\geqslant 2, n \\in \\mathbf{N}^*$ 。\n又  $a_1 = 1$  ，所以  $a_{n} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}1,n = 1\\\\ \\prod_{k = 1}^{n - 1}\\left[(4^{k} - 1)^{2} - 1\\right],n\\geqslant 2 \\end{array} \\right.$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 923,
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 20679
    },
    {
      "height": 349,
      "id": "eb73de48602b445d",
      "text": "##### 例32.9 已知  $a_1 = 5, a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n - 4}{a_n - 3} (n \\geqslant 1)$ ，求通项公式  $a_n$\n分析 数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  满足分式递推关系，构造  $a_{n+1} = f(a_{n}) = \\frac{a_{n}-4}{a_{n}-3}$ ，其中  $f(x) = \\frac{x-4}{x-3}$ ，可利用“不动点法”求通项。函数  $f(x)$  只有唯一的不动点  $x_{0}=2$ ，因此转化为一个等差数列  $\\left\\{\\frac{1}{a_{n}-2}\\right\\}$ ，则易求出通项公式。\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span>  $\\gg$  由  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{a_n - 4}{a_n - 3}$  知可构造  $a_{n + 1} = f(a_n) = \\frac{a_n - 4}{a_n - 3}$ , 其中  $f(x) = \\frac{x - 4}{x - 3}$ .\n解方程  $f(x) = x$ ，即  $\\frac{x - 4}{x - 3} = x, x^2 - 4x + 4 = 0$ ，由题知  $f(x)$  只有唯一不动点  $x_0 = 2$ ，于是可采用如下方法求通项：  $a_{n+1} - 2 = \\frac{a_n - 4}{a_n - 3} - 2 = \\frac{-a_n + 2}{a_n - 3}$ .\n若  $a_{n} = 2$ ，则  $a_{1} = 2 \\neq 5$ ，与题设矛盾，所以  $a_{n} - 2 \\neq 0, \\frac{1}{a_{n + 1} - 2} = \\frac{-a_{n} + 3}{a_{n} - 2} = \\frac{-(a_{n} - 2) + 1}{a_{n} - 2} = -1 + \\frac{1}{a_{n} - 2}$ ，则数列  $\\left\\{\\frac{1}{a_{n} - 2}\\right\\}$  为首项为  $\\frac{1}{a_{1} - 2} = \\frac{1}{3}$ ，公差为-1的等差数列， $\\frac{1}{a_{n} - 2} = \\frac{1}{3} + (n - 1)\\cdot (-1) = \\frac{4}{3} - n = \\frac{4 - 3n}{3}$ .\n故  $a_{n} = 2 + \\frac{3}{4 - 3n} = \\frac{11 - 6n}{4 - 3n} = \\frac{6n - 11}{3n - 4} (n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 745,
      "x": 1835,
      "y": 21451
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "20140fd9b7b2ee7f",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{a_n} - \\frac{1}{a_{n-1}} = d$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 483,
      "y": 20905
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "839889745d5e69b9",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{a_n} - \\sqrt{a_{n-1}} = d$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 537,
      "y": 20741
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "b05a67bbabe91e87",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}-c}-\\frac{1}{a_n-c}=d$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 568,
      "y": 21026
    },
    {
      "height": 75,
      "id": "9c3a765301d05a57",
      "text": "$(a_{n+1} - \\lambda a_n) - (a_n - \\lambda a_{n-1}) = \\mu$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 466,
      "x": 534,
      "y": 21145
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e74adfc96a03a07e",
      "text": "$a_{n}^{2} - a_{n - 1}^{2} = d$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 579,
      "y": 20600
    },
    {
      "height": 340,
      "id": "dafbc5b8abbcd9a0",
      "text": "已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$  若  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,且  $a_{1} = 1,a_{2} = 2,a_{3} = 3$  ,则  $S_{90} =$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 由  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,可知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是个\"类周期数列\".因此可设数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  满足  $b_{n} = a_{3n - 2}+$ $a_{3n - 1} + a_{3n}$  ,则  $b_{n + 1} = a_{3n + 1} + a_{3n + 2} + a_{3n + 3} = a_{3n - 2}+$\n$1 + a_{3n - 1} + 1 + a_{3n} + 1 = b_{n} + 3$  ,于是数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  是公差为3的等差数列,且  $b_{1} = a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3} = 6$  ,于是得到  $S_{90} = (a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3}) + (a_{4} + a_{5} + a_{6}) + \\dots +$ $(a_{88} + a_{89} + a_{90}) = b_{1} + b_{2} + \\dots +b_{30} = 30\\times 6+$ $\\frac{30\\times 29}{2}\\times 3 = 1485.$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">答案</span> 1485",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 532,
      "x": 4471,
      "y": 18020
    },
    {
      "height": 115,
      "id": "3ca4d3a26ae93752",
      "text": "有没有方法检验",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 192,
      "x": 4404,
      "y": 18478
    },
    {
      "height": 476,
      "id": "c584613091d8da59",
      "text": "（1）求形如 $a_{n + 1} = pa_n + q(p\\neq 1)$ 的递推公式的通项，可采用如下两种方法：\n① 待定系数法：设 $a_{n} - x = p(a_{n-1} - x)$ ，用待定系数法可求出 $x = \\frac{q}{1 - p}$ ，进而构造新的等比数列 $\\{a_{n} - x\\}$ ，求出通项。其中 $x$ 为方程 $x = px + q$ 的解，被称为数列的不动点。  \n②也可由 $a_{n + 1} = pa_n + q$ 及 $a_{n} = pa_{n - 1} + q$ ，两式相减得 $a_{n + 1} - a_n = p(a_n - a_{n - 1})$ ，所以 $\\{a_{n + 1} - a_n\\}$ 是首项为 $a_2 - a_1$ ，公比为 $\\ngtr$ 的等比数列，先求 $a_{n + 1} - a_n$ ，再求 $a_{n}$   \n(2) 形如 $a_{n+1} = p a_n + q(n) (p \\neq 1)$ 的递归式, 等号两边同除以 $p^{n+1}$ , 得 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{p^{n+1}} = \\frac{a_n}{p^n} + \\frac{q(n)}{p^{n+1}}$ , 令 $b_n = \\frac{a_n}{p^n}$ , 得 $b_{n+1} = b_n + \\frac{q(n)}{p^{n+1}}$ , 先求 $b_n$ , 再求 $a_n$ .  \n(3) 形如 $a_{n+1} = p a_n^q (p > 0, a_n > 0)$ 的递归式，等号两边取对数有 $\\lg a_{n+1} = q \\lg a_n + \\lg p$ ，令 $b_n = \\lg a_n$ ，则 $b_{n+1} = q b_n + \\lg p$ ，仿(2)得 $b_n$ ，再求 $a_n$ .  \n(4)代换法：代换法主要包括三角代换法、分式代换法与代换相消法等，其中代换相消法可以解决以下类型：\n已知 $a_1 = b, a_2 = c, a_{n+1} = pa_n + qa_{n-1} + r (r \\neq 0)$ , 求通项 $a_n$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 965,
      "x": 440,
      "y": 22440
    },
    {
      "height": 99,
      "id": "59fc3f9ca423494d",
      "text": "在数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 中，已知 $a_1 = 1$ ，若 $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} a_{n - 1} - 1 (n \\geqslant 2)$ ，求 $a_{n}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 444,
      "x": 1835,
      "y": 22440
    },
    {
      "height": 134,
      "id": "572494f8b6eb7adb",
      "text": "在数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 中，已知 $a_1 = 1$\n① 若 $a_{n} = \\frac{1}{2} a_{n - 1} + 2n - 1 (n \\geqslant 2)$ , 求 $a_{n}$ .  \n② 若 $a_{n+1} = 3a_n + 2^n$ ，求 $a_n$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 482,
      "x": 1835,
      "y": 22611
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "c4b7dfed7ded550f",
      "text": "",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 118,
      "y": 22618
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 269,
      "id": "75985cd27e69f714",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-不动点法|不动点法]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 849,
      "x": 818,
      "y": 21451
    },
    {
      "height": 86,
      "id": "a887d15061832b44",
      "text": "判断单调性、最值：将n看作变量，用函、导数做",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 462,
      "x": 118,
      "y": 22114
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e134e59a92f59164",
      "text": "形如  $a_{n + 1} = \\frac{ba_n + c}{da_n + e} (d\\neq 0,be - dc\\neq 0)$  的分式型递推数列，当只有两个不动点时，\n可转化为等比数列求通项.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1885,
      "y": 21787
    },
    {
      "height": 500,
      "id": "2ee8cbfe9f2b3ce6",
      "text": "设二阶常系数线性齐次递推式为 $x_{n + 2} = px_{n + 1} + qx_n (n \\geqslant 1, p, q$ 为常数， $q \\neq 0)$ ，其特征方程为 $x^{2} = px + q$ ，其根为特征根.\n(1) 若特征方程有两个不相等的实数根 $\\alpha, \\beta$ ，则其通项公式为 $x_{n} = A\\alpha^{n} + B\\beta^{n} (n \\geqslant 1)$ ，其中 $A, B$ 由初始值确定.  \n(2) 若特征方程有两个相等的实数根 $\\alpha$ , 则其通项公式为 $x_{n} = [A\\alpha + B(n - 1)]\\alpha^{n - 1}(n \\geqslant 1)$ , 其中 $A, B$ 由初始值确定.\n证明 设特征根为 $\\alpha, \\beta$ ，则\n$\\alpha + \\beta = p, \\alpha \\beta = - q.$\n所以\n$x _ {n + 2} - \\alpha x _ {n + 1} = p x _ {n + 1} + q x _ {n} - \\alpha x _ {n + 1} = (p - \\alpha) x _ {n + 1} + q x _ {n} = \\beta x _ {n + 1} - \\alpha \\beta x _ {n} = \\beta \\left(x _ {n + 1} - \\alpha x _ {n}\\right).$\n故 $\\{x_{n + 1} - \\alpha x_n\\}$ 是以 $\\beta$ 为公比， $x_{2} - \\alpha x_{1}(\\neq 0)$ 为首项的等比数列.从而\n$x _ {n + 1} - \\alpha x _ {n} = (x _ {2} - \\alpha x _ {1}) \\beta^ {n - 1},$\n所以\n$x _ {n} = \\alpha x _ {n - 1} + (x _ {2} - \\alpha x _ {1}) \\beta^ {n - 2}.$\n(1) 当 $\\alpha \\neq \\beta$ 时, 其通项公式为 $x_{n} = A\\alpha^{n} + B\\beta^{n}$ , 其中 $A = \\frac{x_2 - \\beta x_1}{(\\alpha - \\beta)\\alpha}, B = \\frac{x_2 - \\alpha x_1}{(\\alpha - \\beta)\\beta}$ ;  \n(2) 当 $\\alpha = \\beta$ 时, 其通项公式为 $x_{n} = [A\\alpha + B(n - 1)]\\alpha^{n - 1}$ , 其中 $A = \\frac{x_1}{\\alpha}, B = \\frac{x_2 - \\alpha x_1}{\\alpha}$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 1040,
      "x": 480,
      "y": 23060
    },
    {
      "height": 242,
      "id": "1a47ccdf57450d32",
      "text": "面积变化率",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 65,
      "x": -10688,
      "y": 608
    },
    {
      "height": 68,
      "id": "d2714bf70c365f4f",
      "text": "$g'(x)= \\frac{\\Delta S}{\\Delta x}=2x$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 228,
      "x": -9864,
      "y": 589
    },
    {
      "height": 68,
      "id": "efbbee957dd56e72",
      "text": "$f'(g(x))=\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta x} =\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta S} \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta S}{\\Delta x} = f'(s) \\cdot g'(x)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 511,
      "x": -9254,
      "y": 589
    },
    {
      "height": 68,
      "id": "24d62eeee92c6310",
      "text": "$f'(s)=\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta s}=\\frac{3}{2}s^{\\frac{1}{2}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 249,
      "x": -9571,
      "y": 589
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "7faec7839bec7d0e",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-选择性必修第二册/第五章 一元函数的导数及其应用/5.1 导数的概念及其意义/5.1.1 变化率问题|变化率]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 150,
      "x": -10461,
      "y": 698
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "46481b5715ee8b76",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/平均变化率与导数的定义|导数]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 113,
      "x": -10220,
      "y": 698
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "a797aa042cce1f44",
      "text": "关键思想：极限",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 246,
      "x": -10827,
      "y": 1087
    },
    {
      "height": 158,
      "id": "2b5b0bf1c663358e",
      "text": "边长增加引起面积的变动量",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 186,
      "x": -10972,
      "y": 649
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "25072f4a89970560",
      "text": "$V=f(s)=s^{\\frac{3}{2}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 201,
      "x": -9547,
      "y": 449
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "212c9ad978a74f76",
      "text": "$S=g(x)=x^2$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 200,
      "x": -9850,
      "y": 449
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2803878560f2ba94",
      "text": "$V=f(g(x))=x^3$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 238,
      "x": -9117,
      "y": 449
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "d17f890c7e7ea734",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-中线定理|中线定理]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -564,
      "y": 310
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "5566ec527961b805",
      "text": "$\\tan \\frac {\\alpha}{2} = \\pm \\sqrt {\\frac {1 - \\cos \\alpha}{1 + \\cos \\alpha}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1811,
      "y": -3334
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 50,
      "id": "91da849c702698a3",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-放到单位圆中研究|放到单位圆中研究]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 256,
      "x": 2538,
      "y": -3394
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "8a2ac658e5493b6b",
      "text": "$\\sin 2 \\alpha = 2 \\sin \\alpha \\cos \\alpha ,(S_{2\\alpha})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 706,
      "y": -3684
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "8e78ebb8a31b9068",
      "text": "$\\tan 2 \\alpha = \\frac {2 \\tan \\alpha}{1 - \\tan^ {2} \\alpha}.(T_{2\\alpha})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 706,
      "y": -3334
    },
    {
      "height": 50,
      "id": "f50a80911e3c08e5",
      "text": "$\\cos 2 \\alpha = \\cos^ {2} \\alpha - \\sin^ {2} \\alpha ,(C_{2\\alpha})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 706,
      "y": -3504
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "1d8fd1f15cd97fb7",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.5 三角恒等变换/5.5.2 简单的三角恒等变换|简单的三角恒等变换]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 208,
      "x": 1720,
      "y": -3684
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "9d4628b03b17421c",
      "text": "$\\sin {\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} = \\pm {\\sqrt{\\frac{1 - \\cos\\alpha}{2}}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1811,
      "y": -3564
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "40b46d17fe5792b9",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-换元的方法|换元的方法]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 173,
      "x": 1928,
      "y": -3684
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "cacfaba7554fc775",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-化归思想|化归思想]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 164,
      "x": 2101,
      "y": -3684
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2232efb0c11a464c",
      "text": "$\\cos {\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} = \\pm {\\sqrt{\\frac{1 + \\cos\\alpha}{2}}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1811,
      "y": -3454
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "603627c4d01c3f5b",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-两角差的余弦公式|$cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=cos(\\alpha)cos(\\beta)+sin(\\alpha)sin(\\beta)$]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": -394,
      "y": -3187
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "7144e6100be0b787",
      "text": "$sin(\\alpha-\\beta)=sin(\\alpha)cos(\\beta)-cos(\\alpha)sin(\\beta)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": -394,
      "y": -2947
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "718e273f2d8eb6aa",
      "text": "$cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=cos(\\alpha)cos(\\beta)-sin(\\alpha)sin(\\beta)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": -394,
      "y": -3067
    },
    {
      "height": 50,
      "id": "ae20c0c7eefe98b4",
      "text": "$sin(\\alpha+\\beta)=sin(\\alpha)cos(\\beta)+cos(\\alpha)sin(\\beta)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": -394,
      "y": -2827
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "0871735ed96719ca",
      "text": "$\\tan (\\alpha - \\beta) = \\frac {\\tan \\alpha - \\tan \\beta}{1 + \\tan \\alpha \\tan \\beta}. \\quad \\left(\\mathrm{T} _ {(\\alpha - \\beta)}\\right)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": 100,
      "y": -3454
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "8c900335fcd8075e",
      "text": "$\\tan (\\alpha + \\beta) = \\frac {\\tan \\alpha + \\tan \\beta}{1 - \\tan \\alpha \\tan \\beta}, \\quad \\left(\\mathrm{T} _ {(\\alpha + \\beta)}\\right)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 337,
      "x": 166,
      "y": -3334
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 116,
      "id": "d882b8e8a242f4d1",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-参数 φ、ω、A 对函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 图象的影响与图象变换|探索 φ 对 y = sin(x + φ) 图象的影响]]%20图象的影响.md)\n把$y = \\sin x$的图象所有点向左（当 $\\varphi > 0$ 时）或向右（当 $\\varphi < 0$ 时）平移 $|\\varphi|$ 个单位长度，就得到函数 $y = \\sin (x + \\varphi)$ 的图象.\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 415,
      "x": 824,
      "y": -1225
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f856c2634a0c2c55",
      "text": "$cos  2\\alpha = 1 - 2\\sin^{2}\\alpha$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1186,
      "y": -3564
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "c6bda4df827c70df",
      "text": "$cos  2\\alpha = 2\\cos^{2}\\alpha - 1$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1186,
      "y": -3454
    },
    {
      "height": 81,
      "id": "001bd6ab1c50489f",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-三角函数模型描述周期运动变化现象|三角函数模型描述周期运动变化现象]]\n- [[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 的物理意义与简谐运动模型|简谐运动]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 308,
      "x": 2770,
      "y": -1562
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "45c561e12e787795",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.7 三角函数的应用/5.7 三角函数的应用|5.7 三角函数的应用]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 2700,
      "y": -1649
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "0a29fdb4321acb9d",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-三角函数描述局部近似周期变化|三角函数描述局部近似周期变化]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 282,
      "x": 2856,
      "y": -1428
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "34503af45142a79d",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-反三角函数|反三角函数]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": 3258,
      "y": -1428
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "068692a86b252ddb",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/题型/按章节分类/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.7 三角函数的应用/习题5.7|习题5.7 三角函数的应用]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 3178,
      "y": -1649
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "1258ef960351ab46",
      "text": "$\\cos \\theta +\\cos \\varphi = 2\\cos \\frac{\\theta + \\varphi}{2}\\cos \\frac{\\theta - \\varphi}{2}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 425,
      "x": 2453,
      "y": -3174
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 132,
      "id": "042587a25933029b",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-参数 φ、ω、A 对函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 图象的影响与图象变换|探索omega对正弦型函数图象的影响]]%20对%20y%20=%20sin(ωx%20+%20φ)%20图象的影响.md)\n把 $y = \\sin (x + \\varphi)$ 图象上所有点的横坐标缩短（当 $\\omega > 1$ 时）或伸长（当 $0 < \\omega < 1$ 时）到原来的 $\\frac{1}{\\omega}$ 倍（纵坐标不变），就得到 $y = \\sin (\\omega x + \\varphi)$ 的图象.\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 415,
      "x": 824,
      "y": -1044
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 118,
      "id": "1bf6083b2a144fa1",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-参数 φ、ω、A 对函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 图象的影响与图象变换|探索A对正弦型函数图象的影响]]%20对%20y%20=%20A%20sin(ωx%20+%20φ)%20图象的影响.md)\n把 $y=\\sin(\\omega x+\\varphi)$ 图象上所有点的纵坐标伸长（当 A>1 时）或缩短（当 0<A<1 时）到原来的 A 倍（横坐标不变）而得到",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 415,
      "x": 824,
      "y": -847
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 238,
      "id": "9740e8add5f48331",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-参数 φ、ω、A 对函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 图象的影响与图象变换|通过图象变换得到 y = A sin(ωx + φ)的图象]]的图象.md)\n\n- 把$y = \\sin x$向左（或右）平移 $|\\varphi|$ 个单位长度，得到函数 $y = \\sin (x + \\varphi)$ 的图象；\n- 然后把曲线上各点的横坐标变为原来的 $\\frac{1}{\\omega}$ 倍（纵坐标不变），得到函数 $y = \\sin (\\omega x + \\varphi)$ 的图象；\n- 最后把曲线上各点的纵坐标变为原来的 $A$ 倍（横坐标不变），这时的曲线就是函数 $y = A\\sin (\\omega x + \\varphi)$ 的图象.\n\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 469,
      "x": 2034,
      "y": -1096
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f7f7c5e03f28ab9e",
      "text": "$\\sin \\theta -\\sin \\varphi = 2\\cos \\frac{\\theta + \\varphi}{2}\\sin \\frac{\\theta - \\varphi}{2}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 425,
      "x": 2457,
      "y": -2936
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "9e33baf9d5762ebe",
      "text": "$y = \\sin x$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 102,
      "x": 1297,
      "y": -1139
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f088e314aecaddfc",
      "text": "$y = A\\sin (\\omega x + \\varphi)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 170,
      "x": 1579,
      "y": -1139
    },
    {
      "height": 50,
      "id": "6e296051aabe4ba2",
      "text": "$\\sin \\theta +\\sin \\varphi = 2\\sin {\\frac{\\theta + \\varphi}{2}}\\cos {\\frac{\\theta - \\varphi}{2}}.$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 421,
      "x": 2457,
      "y": -2816
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "c5ba3649e13dbb6a",
      "text": "$\\cos \\theta -\\cos \\varphi = -2\\sin \\frac{\\theta + \\varphi}{2}\\sin \\frac{\\theta - \\varphi}{2}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 425,
      "x": 2457,
      "y": -3056
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "c5f8d0d0c4c42f80",
      "text": "$(x,y)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 102,
      "x": 1297,
      "y": -1007
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "684c8ed6e781c855",
      "text": "变换后图像",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 170,
      "x": 1579,
      "y": -877
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "6630ef840f986aea",
      "text": "$(\\omega x + \\varphi,\\frac{y}{A})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 170,
      "x": 1579,
      "y": -1007
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "124bd0812ffeb1cd",
      "text": "图像",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 102,
      "x": 1297,
      "y": -877
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "ad6270c852a69933",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-利用三角恒等变化解决最值问题|利用三角恒等变化解决最值问题]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 2180,
      "y": -2590
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 157,
      "id": "91e96e2485e89ed1",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-函数 y=Asin(ωx+φ) 及 y=Acos(ωx+φ) 的周期推导|探究与发现 正余弦型函数周期性]]%20和%20y%20=%20A%20cos(ωx+φ)%20的周期性。.md)\n- $y = f(x)$的周期是$T$,那么$y = f(\\omega x)$      ($\\omega>0$)的周期$\\frac{T}{\\omega}$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 306,
      "x": 824,
      "y": -1487
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "56ef8bef228ccc08",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/题型/按章节分类/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.6 函数 y = A sin(ωx + φ)/习题5.6|习题5.6 函数 y = A sin(ωx + φ)]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 351,
      "x": 2269,
      "y": -1739
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 171,
      "id": "95f4bb69921ee935",
      "text": "函数 $y=A\\sin(\\omega x+\\varphi)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 294,
      "x": 1353,
      "y": -1580
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "9d5f5b5989a8f655",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.6 函数 y = A sin(ωx + φ)/5.6 函数 y = A sin(ωx + φ)|5.6 函数 y = A sin(ωx + φ)]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 244,
      "x": 727,
      "y": -1739
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2db2cee6f039120e",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-匀速圆周运动的数学模型|匀速圆周运动的数学模型]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 852,
      "y": -1640
    },
    {
      "height": 50,
      "id": "e4d2307980774bfc",
      "text": "$\\sin \\alpha \\cos \\beta = \\frac{1}{2} [\\sin (\\alpha +\\beta) + \\sin (\\alpha -\\beta)]$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 515,
      "x": 1780,
      "y": -2816
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "89d7ffe70e7b0ec8",
      "text": "$\\sin \\alpha \\sin \\beta = -\\frac{1}{2} [\\cos (\\alpha +\\beta) - \\cos (\\alpha -\\beta)]$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 518,
      "x": 1780,
      "y": -3056
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "63d0b38b19a48da8",
      "text": "$\\cos \\alpha \\cos \\beta = \\frac{1}{2} [\\cos (\\alpha +\\beta) + \\cos (\\alpha -\\beta)]$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 515,
      "x": 1780,
      "y": -3176
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "e24188034c5c24a5",
      "text": "$\\cos \\alpha \\sin \\beta = \\frac{1}{2} [\\sin (\\alpha +\\beta) - \\sin (\\alpha -\\beta)]$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 515,
      "x": 1782,
      "y": -2936
    },
    {
      "height": 120,
      "id": "5e517b9a5e0a5c5d",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-辅助角公式|辅助角公式]]\n- $a\\sin x + b\\cos x = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \\cdot \\sin(x + \\varphi)$\n  ,$\\quad \\sin\\varphi = \\frac{b}{\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}}$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 344,
      "x": 1328,
      "y": -2620
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f7680e6f7e030f20",
      "text": "$sin 15^{\\circ}、cos 75^{\\circ}$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -84,
      "y": -2540
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 50,
      "id": "e801d05407661e31",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-二倍角的正弦、余弦、正切公式|二倍角的正弦、余弦、正切公式]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 276,
      "x": 956,
      "y": -3740
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f8acdd4e30370d02",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/题型/按章节分类/人教A-必修第一册/第五章 三角函数/5.5 三角恒等变换/习题5.5|习题5.5 三角恒等变换]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 2794,
      "y": -3840
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "0d444ff465b14699",
      "text": "体积增加$\\Delta V=f'(s) \\cdot g'(x) \\cdot \\Delta x$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 440,
      "x": -9837,
      "y": 950
    },
    {
      "height": 69,
      "id": "76b5a6e35e143249",
      "text": "边长增加$\\Delta x$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 217,
      "x": -9724,
      "y": 751
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "580d1f65ac78eab5",
      "text": "体积增加$\\Delta V=f'(s)\\cdot \\Delta s$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 350,
      "x": -9229,
      "y": 950
    },
    {
      "height": 69,
      "id": "504ebc2e29f37777",
      "text": "面积增加$\\Delta S=g'(x) \\cdot \\Delta x$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 350,
      "x": -9229,
      "y": 751
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "f1c1b8334be4111c",
