      "x": 2960,
      "y": -1229
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 170,
      "id": "e3df4ff89a82f239",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-正弦函数、余弦函数的单调性|正弦函数的单调性]]\n- 单调递增\n  $\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2} + 2k\\pi, \\frac{\\pi}{2} + 2k\\pi\\right](k \\in \\mathbf{Z})$ \n- 单调递减\n  $\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2} + 2k\\pi, \\frac{3\\pi}{2} + 2k\\pi\\right](k \\in \\mathbf{Z})$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 284,
      "x": -1047,
      "y": -1554
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "2fc9b86706aeb14b",
