      "type": "text",
      "width": 120,
      "x": -9840,
      "y": -3572
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "b6345983107bfbd1",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第四章 指数函数与对数函数/阅读与思考 对数的发明|阅读与思考 对数的发明]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -9080,
      "y": -3572
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 157,
      "id": "9f3b514bc973c2e5",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-对数函数的概念|对数函数的概念]]\n-  $y=\\log_{a}x(a>0$ ，且 $a\\neq1)$\n- x 是自变量，定义域是 $(0,+\\infty)$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": -8595,
      "y": -3340
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "d76849cddecf4545",
      "text": "比大小",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -7435,
      "y": -3921
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "5050ed65d5e03395",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/概念或公式/概念-对数函数|4.4 对数函数]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -8720,
      "y": -3572
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "5b930803b387d1be",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/题型/按章节分类/人教A-必修第一册/第四章 指数函数与对数函数/4.3 对数/习题4.3|习题4.3 对数]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -9421,
      "y": -3572
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 180,
      "id": "d8bdc45736e0c878",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第四章 指数函数与对数函数/4.3 对数/4.3.2 对数的运算|对数的运算]]\n1. $\\log_a(MN) = \\log_aM + \\log_aN;$   \n2. $\\log_a\\frac{M}{N} = \\log_aM - \\log_aN;$ \n3. $\\log_a M^n = n\\log_a M (n \\in \\mathbf{R})$ .\n4. $\\log_ {a} b = \\frac {\\log_ {c} b}{\\log_ {c} a} (a > 0, \\text {且} a \\neq 1; b > 0; c > 0, \\text {且} c \\neq 1).$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 405,
      "x": -9720,
      "y": -3252
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 90,
      "id": "3b7dae5462f3b796",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/概念或公式/概念-n次方根|n次方根]]\n-  $x^{n}=a$ ",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 159,
      "x": -9940,
      "y": -4527
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "1772067403601f40",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识串联/人教A-必修第一册/第四章 指数函数与对数函数/第四章 指数函数与对数函数 小结|指数函数与对数函数 小结]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": -5538,
      "y": -4672
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 160,
      "id": "5387ba84cdc6c1cf",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-分数指数幂与有理数指数幂的运算性质|指数幂的运算性质]]\n 1.  $a^r a^s = a^{r + s}$ $(a > 0, r, s \\in \\mathbf{R})$ ;   \n 2. $(a^r)^s = a^{rs}$ ( $a > 0$ , $r$ , $s \\in \\mathbf{R}$ );   \n 3.  $(ab)^{r} = a^{r}b^{r}$ $(a > 0, b > 0, r \\in \\mathbf{R})$ .",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 315,
      "x": -9395,
      "y": -4222
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 50,
      "id": "e62efb4bcff4cf7e",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-无理数指数幂及其运算性质|无理数指数幂也是实数]]\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 222,
      "x": -9615,
      "y": -4356
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 120,
      "id": "26796e06c0b59268",
      "text": "[[Mathmap/知识点/知识点-分数指数幂与有理数指数幂的运算性质|分数指数幂]]\n1. $a ^ {\\frac {m}{n}} = \\sqrt [ n ]{a ^ {m}} (a > 0, m, n \\in \\mathrm{N} ^ {*}, n > 1).$\n2. $a ^ {- \\frac {m}{n}} = \\frac {1}{a ^ {\\frac {m}{n}}} = \\frac {1}{\\sqrt [ n ]{a ^ {m}}} (a > 0, m, n \\in \\mathbf {N} ^ {*}, n > 1).$",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 351,
      "x": -9682,
      "y": -4542
    },
    {
      "color": "2",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "5b947c17910fdf45",
